    "description": "Ideally located in one of Saint-Tropez’s most sought-after neighborhoods, just moments from the iconic Canoubiers Beach, this exceptional property enjoys a privileged setting within more than two hectares of beautifully landscaped grounds, offering charming sea views and complete privacy.\n\nWith approximately 300 sqm of living space, the estate stands out for its elegant architecture and thoughtfully designed layout, perfectly suited for hosting family and guests. Comprising a main villa and an independent guest house, it combines timeless character, contemporary comfort, and the relaxed Mediterranean lifestyle for which Saint-Tropez is renowned.\n\nFully renovated using high-quality materials, the main villa spans approximately 200 sqm and immediately impresses with its generous volumes and abundant natural light. The reception areas open seamlessly onto the outdoor spaces, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. A spacious living room flows naturally into a fully equipped contemporary kitchen, designed as a true gathering place. The sleeping quarters feature three elegant en-suite bedrooms, each offering refined finishes and exceptional comfort.\n\nPerfectly integrated into its surroundings, the independent guest house is arranged over two levels and offers two beautiful suites as well as a self-contained apartment. This additional accommodation provides an ideal setting for welcoming family, friends, or staff while ensuring complete privacy for all.\n\nOutside, the meticulously maintained landscaped grounds create a truly exceptional environment, a rare offering in Saint-Tropez. Mediterranean plantings, expansive lawns, and multiple terraces invite residents to fully embrace the Côte d’Azur lifestyle. At the heart of the garden, a magnificent swimming pool blends harmoniously into the surroundings, providing a peaceful retreat dedicated to relaxation and well-being.\n\nA rare opportunity combining privacy, elegance, and high-end amenities in one of Saint-Tropez’s most exclusive locations.",
