    "description": "At the heart of the highly exclusive Cap d’Antibes, just moments from the sea and nestled within a lush green setting overlooking the Mediterranean, Domaine de la Belle Étoile stands as one of the rarest properties currently available on the French Riviera.\nSet across 1.47 hectares, one of the largest private plots on the Cap, this private estate comprises three independent villas totaling 1,489 sqm of living space, surrounded by exceptional landscaped grounds including an olive grove, rose garden, Mediterranean gardens, swimming pool, spa and expansive outdoor reception areas.\n\nThe Main Villa :\nThe true centrepiece of the estate, this contemporary architect-designed villa spans three levels and offers:\n6 suites, including a 100 sqm principal suite with dual bathrooms and walk-in wardrobes\nSpacious reception areas opening onto terraces and the pool\nFamily kitchen and separate professional chef’s kitchen\nFully equipped gym and yoga/pilates space\nComplete spa featuring sauna, steam room, ice room and experience shower\nCinema & games room\nFull Crestron home automation system\nShow garage for 3 vehicles with EV charging stations\n\nTwo Independent Guest Houses :\nVilla Céleste – 2 bedrooms : Former 1930s tennis clubhouse, elegantly restored, blending historic French charm with contemporary comfort.\nVilla Capella – 1 bedroom : Former fisherman’s cottage transformed into a contemporary two-level retreat, featuring a rooftop terrace with panoramic views over the estate and the Mediterranean.\n\nAn Estate Designed as a Private Resort :\nMain swimming pool\nPool house & summer kitchen\nSecurity lodge\n5 garages + 11 outdoor parking spaces\nHigh-end technical systems (underfloor heating, reversible air conditioning, air treatment system, comprehensive security)\nAn Exceptional Heritage Opportunity\n\nA truly rare acquisition on one of Europe’s most prestigious and protected addresses.",
