    "description": "Exclusive listing – West Lyon – Confidential and secure setting.\nMagnificent estate offering 648 sqm (575 sqm of living space), fully renovated in 2023, comprising a main architect-designed villa (538 sqm), an independent caretaker’s house (57 sqm), and a guest house (53 sqm), all set within a fully private 1.68-hectare wooded domain. The main villa features unique, high-end contemporary amenities: a stunning entrance hall, an impressive living room with fireplace and home cinema area, a premium open-plan kitchen with pantry and separate staff entrance opening onto a patio with barbecue/plancha, a relaxation area with bar and billiards, and a mezzanine office space. The night area includes a spectacular master suite of approximately 100 sqm with two large walk-in closets, a bathroom with whirlpool bath and spacious shower, and a private terrace with jacuzzi. Four additional en-suite bedrooms each benefit from private terraces. A complete wellness area includes a hammam, massage room, and fitness room. Outdoor spaces are perfectly designed for summer living and entertaining: a beautiful heated swimming pool (12 x 5 m), a large pool house with bar and barbecue/plancha area, an outdoor cinema space with fire pit, a pétanque court, and a tennis court. At the entrance of the property, the caretaker’s house features a living room with open-plan kitchen, one bedroom with shower room, a private terrace and garden, and two parking spaces. Located near the pool area, the independent guest house offers a living area with open kitchen and one bedroom with shower room.\nAdditional features: double garage, carport for 3 to 4 vehicles, extensive parking area, and helipad (authorization for 10 rotations per year). Technical and security equipment: air conditioning, home automation system, alarm, video surveillance, indoor and outdoor sound system. Private schools and shops nearby.",
