    "description": "EXCLUSIVE – MEGEVE: An Exceptional Ski-in / Ski-out Chalet\nLocated in the heart of the highly coveted Rochebrune area, within a preserved environment just 800 meters from the village center, this 1,000 sqm (10,764 sq ft) chalet stands as one of Megève’s most remarkable architectural signatures. Featuring direct slope access and panoramic mountain views, this property offers a rare living experience, blending grand volumes, absolute discretion, and bespoke amenities.\n\nLiving Spaces & Entertaining\nBuilt across six levels connected by a private elevator, the chalet reveals light-filled, generous spaces. The reception level centers around a double living room with a majestic fireplace, a bar, and a spacious lounge. Expansive openings onto a sun-drenched terrace allow for a breathtaking panorama of the surrounding peaks. On the top floor, a dedicated conference and workspace offers absolute tranquility facing the mountains.\n\nThe Art of Relaxation and Privacy\nAn entire floor is dedicated to wellness and rejuvenation, featuring an indoor swimming pool, a sauna, a hammam, and a fitness room. A music room and a lounge-bar area complete this space, designed for private gatherings and ultimate conviviality.\n\nThe sleeping quarters can accommodate up to 16 guests, featuring four elegant suites with private terraces and a refined children's dormitory. The uppermost floor is exclusively reserved for the 80 sqm (861 sq ft) Master Suite—a true private apartment with its own fireplace, offering a commanding view over the resort.\n\nHigh-End Amenities\nThe lower level meets every functional requirement: a secure garage for seven vehicles, independent staff quarters, a wine tasting cellar, and a professional-grade ski room.\n\nLocated just one hour from Geneva, this exceptional chalet represents a rare opportunity to own a world-class estate in Megève’s most desirable location.\n\nKey Features:\n1,000 sqm across 6 levels | Private Elevator | Ski-in / Ski-out\n80 sqm Master Suite + 4 Guest Suites + Children’s Dormitory\nFull Wellness Floor: Indoor Pool, Spa, Hammam, Fitness & Lounge\n7-car Garage | Staff Accommodations | Professional Ski-room\nPanoramic Views | Immediate proximity to the village center\n\nFull file and private viewing upon request.",
