    "description": "At Cap de Nice, along the iconic coastal path, this 330 sqm villa offers a unique lifestyle in harmony with the sea.\nThe main access by road is through a private and secure estate.\nSpread over three levels and facing due south, the property enjoys maximum sunlight and complete privacy.\nWe enter through the upper level into a bright living space, like a painting, composed of a spacious sea-facing living room and an intimate office.\nThe intermediate level is dedicated to the sleeping area. It features three bedrooms sharing two bathrooms, along with a master suite with its own bathroom and a stunning bathtub overlooking the sea. You can host family and guests here in absolute comfort, like being aboard a yacht.\nOn the lower level, a large, light-filled space opening onto the outdoors combines a kitchen, living room, and dining area, creating the perfect setting for shared moments.\nSpectacular—this is not just a sea view, it is the Mediterranean that belongs to you. A piece of the cape is part of the property, which also includes a swimming pool overlooking the sea and an expansive terrace resembling a private beach.\nYou will also benefit from two private accesses to the sea and to the coastal path, allowing you to enjoy a small cove with turquoise waters, like a natural pool.\nThe Cap de Nice area is one of the most sought-after locations on the French Riviera, just minutes from the Port and the city center. An exceptional address for clients seeking rarity, discretion, and a lifestyle entirely centered around the Mediterranean.\nThe property currently offers two outdoor parking spaces, with the possibility of creating at least three additional spaces, covered or not.\nAnother major asset of this outstanding property is its exceptional profitability as a seasonal rental. If you choose not to reside there, it can become a highly lucrative investment (8% annual return on Airbnb, with further optimization potential).",
