    "description": "Megève Center – An exceptional location, the \"everything on foot\" lifestyle.\n\nLocated in the heart of the mythical village of Megève, in one of its most sought-after and privileged areas, this authentic chalet is an absolute rarity on the current market. Combining discretion and prestige, this property benefits from a strategic address, offering immediate and privileged access to luxury boutiques, renowned restaurants, and the \"Le Chamois\" ski lifts.\n\nBuilt on a constructible plot — a true real estate gem in the village center — this perfectly maintained chalet features a total surface area of 158 m² (including 141 m² of living space). From the moment you step inside, it charms with its Savoyard soul, preserved alpine character, and a resolutely warm atmosphere.\n\nAn Interior Bathed in Light and Serenity\nThe ground floor opens onto a grand reception room. This living space, filled with natural light thanks to large windows, includes a convivial lounge perfect for relaxation, an elegant dining room, and a high-end, fully equipped open-plan kitchen. This area extends naturally onto a vast, sun-drenched terrace—a true summer lounge offering an intimate outdoor living space in any season.\n\nUpstairs, the sleeping quarters have been designed as a cozy sanctuary. It consists of four comfortable bedrooms, using noble materials to provide a functional and snug setting, ideal for hosting family and guests in the purest mountain spirit.\n\nUnique Value Potential: Extension Project\nThe true crown jewel of this property is its buildable land, an opportunity that has become extremely rare in the center of the resort. This land allows for the creation of a second independent chalet with outbuildings, offering an additional floor area of approximately 350 m².\n\nA building permit has already been granted, providing immediate and secure visibility for your future architectural project. Whether as a primary residence, a family holiday home, or a top-tier heritage investment, this property offers exceptional valuation prospects.\n\nLocated just 1 hour from Geneva International Airport, this property embodies the perfect blend of authenticity, modern comfort, and development potential. A unique opportunity to write your own chapter in the history of Megève.",
