    "description": "Just a short walk from Place des Lices, in a highly sought-after setting and within immediate proximity to all amenities, this charming former bastide offers approximately 320 sqm of living space.\n\nSet on a landscaped plot of around 1,560 sqm, the property is arranged around a main house complemented by two independent annexes, providing an ideal layout for hosting guests in complete privacy.\n\nThe main residence, spread over two levels, features generous volumes, including a bright and spacious living room, an open-plan kitchen extended by a welcoming dining area, as well as an elegant master suite with a bathroom featuring a hammam, a dressing room, and a study. A second bedroom is set within a tower, adding a distinctive architectural character.\n\nThe first annex comprises a bedroom with en-suite shower room and WC, along with a staff bedroom. The second annex also offers a bedroom with en-suite facilities. An extension project, with planning permission currently in progress, would allow the creation of two additional en-suite bedrooms through a vertical extension.\n\nOutdoors, a superb fully equipped pool house opens onto a heated mirror pool, creating a dedicated space for relaxation and entertaining. The basement further enhances the property with a wine cellar and a cinema room.\n\nThe carefully landscaped garden features multiple lounging areas, inviting you to fully enjoy the Mediterranean lifestyle. An outdoor parking area completes the features of this exceptional property.",
