    "description": "BETWEEN CORDON AND COMBLOUX: EXCEPTIONAL CHALET-HOTEL – RESIDENTIAL, HOSPITALITY, AND EVENT POTENTIAL\nIdeally located in a preserved alpine setting between Cordon and Combloux, just 5 minutes from the \"Princesse\" gondola (direct access to the Megève ski area), this 4-star Chalet-Hotel represents a rare real estate opportunity. A former hotel-chalet renovated with rare elegance, the property offers 810 m² of living space within a total surface area of 1,756 m², set upon a dominant plot of nearly 3,000 m².\n\nA UNIQUE VENUE FOR PRESTIGE EVENTS\nBeyond its hospitality function, this estate was designed to host exceptional events. Thanks to its extraordinary volumes and modular reception spaces, it provides an ideal setting for:\n\nCorporate Events: Executive seminars, product launches, or luxury retreats, featuring fully equipped meeting rooms and total spatial flexibility.\n\nPrivate Receptions: Exclusive weddings, anniversaries, or family celebrations, benefiting from a unique guest capacity and a spectacular panorama of the mountain peaks.\n\nVERSATILITY OF USE: PRIVATE RESIDENCE OR HOSPITALITY\nCurrently unbranded (libre d'enseigne), this property offers total flexibility. It can maintain its vocation as a boutique hotel or be transformed into a majestic private residence. It features 14 spacious bedrooms and suites, each offering 4-star comfort and total immersion in the mountain landscape. The vast lounges with fireplaces and the grand dining room reinforce the sense of absolute exclusivity.\n\nWELLNESS AND PREMIUM AMENITIES\nThe experience is enhanced by a comprehensive wellness area, including a spa with treatment rooms, a sauna, a hammam, a jacuzzi, and a panoramic terrace with a swimming pool facing the mountain ranges. A large secure underground car park and a professional ski room complete this high-end ensemble.\n\nA RARE PATRIMONIAL INVESTMENT\nSold as a freehold (pleine propriété), this asset stands out for its versatility. Whether continuing a luxury hotel operation, creating a private family estate, or operating a strategic event venue at the gates of Megève, the valuation possibilities are exceptional.\n\nSummary: 810 m² living space (1,756 m² total) | 2,989 m² plot | 14 suites | Spa | Swimming Pool | Underground Parking | Major event potential.\n\nFull file and private viewing upon request.",
