    "description": "Located in Eygalières, one of the most exclusive villages in Provence, this exceptional luxury property offers a rare opportunity to acquire a private estate in the heart of the Alpilles, surrounded by nature with no immediate neighbors and unobstructed views over olive groves and vineyards.\n\nSet on approximately 1 hectare of landscaped land with over 250 olive trees, this high-end contemporary villa offers around 500 sqm of total living space and has been designed to meet the expectations of an international luxury real estate clientele.\n\nThe property features expansive living areas including a bright open-plan living room, dining area and fully equipped kitchen, all seamlessly connected to outdoor terraces through large floor-to-ceiling windows.\n\nThe villa offers 5 en-suite bedrooms, each with private bathrooms, ensuring comfort and privacy for both family living and high-end rental use.\n\nPremium amenities include a 15-meter swimming pool with movable floor, home cinema, fitness room, hammam, wine cellar and game room, creating a true private resort atmosphere.\n\nOutdoor facilities include multiple lounge areas, a pool house, pétanque court and a private padel court — rare features that significantly enhance the property’s appeal on the luxury market.\n\nSold fully furnished and professionally designed, the property is ready for immediate occupancy and perfectly suited as a luxury second home or an investment property.\n\nWith an estimated seasonal rental income between €250,000 and €350,000 per year, this estate represents a strong investment opportunity in the Provence luxury real estate market.\n\nA unique turnkey property combining privacy, lifestyle, design and profitability in one of the most desirable locations in the South of France. For further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact me directly Valentin Lamont at +33 6 88 94 71 93 (calls, SMS and WhatsApp available).",
