    "description": "Located in the heart of the sought-after village of Paradou, just minutes from the stunning Alpilles, this exceptional 18th-century Provençal estate offers over 600 sqm of fully renovated living space in a peaceful and authentic environment.\n\nThis character property perfectly combines traditional charm—exposed stone, vaulted ceilings, generous volumes—with high-end contemporary amenities. Designed as a versatile living space, the estate is divided into several independent units, making it ideal as a primary residence, luxury second home, or a high-end hospitality project such as a boutique hotel or guesthouse.\n\nThe main residence features an impressive 120 sqm vaulted reception room, ideal for entertaining, including a bar, dining area and home cinema lounge. Five en-suite bedrooms provide privacy and comfort, some with private terraces and kitchenettes. An additional independent guest house offers a living area, kitchenette, bedroom and bathroom.\n\nThe landscaped Mediterranean garden includes a 14-meter heated swimming pool, a fully equipped pool house with summer kitchen, and multiple relaxation areas. A dedicated wellness space with gym, sauna and massage room enhances the lifestyle appeal.\n\nA separate high-end private apartment completes the property, featuring a double living room with fireplace, dining area, fully equipped kitchen, bedroom with dressing room and en-suite bathroom.\n\nWithin walking distance of local shops and restaurants, and close to Saint-Rémy-de-Provence and Les Baux-de-Provence, this rare estate represents a prime investment opportunity in the Provence luxury real estate market. For any inquiries or to arrange a visit, please contact Valentin Lamont directly at +33 6 88 94 71 93 (calls / SMS / WhatsApp available).",
