    "description": "Located in a private and secure estate in Mougins, this unoverlooked property features a villa with over 500 sqm of living space, set within landscaped grounds of more than 4,000 sqm.\n\nUpon entering, a central staircase serves the different levels, leading to a large, bright living room equipped with wide floor-to-ceiling windows that open onto stone terraces. The kitchen is finished to professional standards; combining a sleek contemporary aesthetic with high-performance equipment, it provides a space that is as functional as it is inviting. The sleeping quarters comprise five suites facing the outdoors, while additional amenities include a gym, a sauna, and an independent studio for guests or staff.\n\nOutside, the large garden—planted with palm trees and Mediterranean species—features a large swimming pool and several relaxation areas. Designed to preserve privacy, these grounds offer spacious shaded areas and terraces ideal for outdoor entertaining.\n\nFor outdoor enthusiasts, the property benefits from quick access to the adjacent forest. This preserved natural setting is perfect for running or cycling directly from the villa, offering an immediate transition between the living space and nature.\n\nThe villa's location balances residential tranquility with city life. Situated just minutes from the center of Cannes, the Croisette, and the beaches, the property provides easy access to the coast's shops, restaurants, and events, while maintaining the comfort of an estate set back from the urban bustle.\n\nMore than just a residence, this rare property embodies a balanced lifestyle, where luxury is measured in space, light, and serenity.",
