    "description": "Nestled within one of Ramatuelle’s most exclusive and sought-after residential enclaves, just minutes from the charming village and the world-renowned beaches of Pampelonne, this exceptional contemporary estate perfectly embodies Mediterranean luxury living. Boasting beautiful sea views and a stunning natural setting, the property offers a rare combination of privacy, tranquility, and sophistication.\n\nSet on more than 6,000 sqm of meticulously landscaped grounds adorned with Mediterranean species, lush gardens, and a private vineyard, this remarkable architectural achievement captivates from the very first glance. Its sleek contemporary lines, generous proportions, and seamless integration into the surrounding landscape create an atmosphere of understated elegance and refinement.\n\nOffering over 630 sqm of built area, including approximately 506 sqm of living space, the villa has been thoughtfully designed to maximize natural light and take full advantage of its exceptional sea views. Expansive floor-to-ceiling windows create a seamless connection between the interior and exterior living spaces, enhancing the sense of openness and bringing the beauty of the surroundings indoors.\n\nThe impressive double reception room opens onto vast terraces overlooking the Mediterranean Sea, creating an ideal setting for both relaxation and entertaining. The dining area flows naturally into a fully equipped state-of-the-art kitchen featuring premium appliances and refined finishes. A professional back kitchen, complete with a genuine walk-in cold room, provides an exceptional level of functionality rarely found in private residences and is perfectly suited for large-scale entertaining.\n\nThe sleeping quarters comprise six luxurious en-suite bedrooms, each offering privacy, comfort, and high-end finishes. Occupying an entire private floor, the magnificent primary suite serves as a true owner's retreat, featuring dual custom walk-in dressing rooms, a spacious bathroom with both bathtub and walk-in shower, and a private terrace enjoying beautiful sea views.\n\nDesigned to satisfy the most discerning clientele, the property also features an extensive range of wellness and leisure amenities, including a private cinema room, a fully equipped fitness center, a sauna, and a hammam. Every detail has been carefully considered to provide an unparalleled lifestyle experience throughout the year.\n\nOutdoors, expansive terraces invite residents and guests to fully embrace the exceptional Côte d’Azur climate. The spectacular swimming pool, measuring approximately 16 meters by 5 meters, forms the centerpiece of the outdoor living spaces and is complemented by an elegant, fully equipped pool house, ideal for entertaining while enjoying breathtaking views over the Mediterranean landscape.\n\nA large secure garage accommodates several vehicles, while state-of-the-art security systems and modern technical equipment ensure maximum comfort, privacy, and peace of mind.\n\nA truly rare opportunity on the market, this outstanding property combines contemporary architecture, exceptional amenities, beautiful sea views, and a prime location within one of the most prestigious areas of the Gulf of Saint-Tropez.",
