    "description": "Eygalières. Nestled in the heart of the Alpilles, in one of Provence’s most sought-after and secluded villages, this exceptional property offers a rare immersion in an authentic and refined lifestyle.\nSet within a magnificent landscaped park of approximately 1.1 hectares, this fully renovated stone residence enjoys a pristine setting of absolute tranquility.\nDesigned as a true family home, the property elegantly combines the charm of traditional Provençal farmhouses with the most modern high-end amenities. Old stone, exposed beams, period fireplaces, fine woods, custom ironwork, and carefully selected materials come together to form a harmonious whole where every detail contributes to the soul of the place.\nThe ground floor is organized around a spacious entry hall leading to an elegant living room, a large reception area with a dining room, and a contemporary open-concept kitchen that flows out onto the terraces and gardens. The sleeping quarters feature four suites, two of which are on the ground floor. Upstairs, the other two suites open onto a superb terrace offering a remarkable view of the Alpilles and the old village.\nOutside, the wooded grounds, dotted with olive trees, cypresses, lavender, and Mediterranean flora, are a true haven of peace. Several relaxation areas have been created to fully enjoy every moment of the day: a lounge area, shaded terraces, a summer kitchen, a pool house, and intimate reception areas\nGreat care has been taken with the amenities designed for well-being: a 16-meter heated infinity pool clad in Balinese stone, a second pool with a counter-current system and a relaxation area, a custom-built sauna, a gym, a pétanque court, a wine cellar, a carport, and an electric vehicle charging station.\nSecluded yet never isolated, this property enjoys a prime location in the immediate vicinity of the village center, the finest establishments in the Alpilles, several renowned golf courses, Saint-Rémy-de-Provence, the Avignon TGV station, and Marseille-Provence International Airport.\nA rare property where authenticity, elegance, and Provençal hospitality come together to offer a unique living experience. A true favorite.\nContact Nathalie Normand +33(6)34158393 nathalie@kretz.fr",
