    "description": "Just steps from the pedestrian center of Megève, this remarkable chalet of approximately 500 m² embodies the refined art of Alpine living. Completely redesigned and enhanced by renowned architects, it elegantly combines contemporary design, exceptional materials, and top-of-the-range amenities.\n\nIdeally located in one of the village's most sought-after areas, it offers the privilege of immediate access to Megève's shops, restaurants, and entertainment, while maintaining an intimate and peaceful atmosphere.\n\nSpread over four levels served by an elevator, the chalet reveals generous and perfectly arranged spaces, designed to offer absolute comfort in every season.\n\nThe garden level features a sumptuous wellness area including an indoor pool, a hammam, a gym, and a fully equipped ski room.\n\nThe sleeping area, located on the ground floor, offers four spacious en suite bedrooms with private bathrooms or shower rooms, two of which have dressing rooms. A laundry room and a separate WC complete this level.\n\nOn the first floor, the reception areas are arranged around a fully equipped kitchen, an elegant bar area, a welcoming dining room, and a spectacular glass-enclosed wine cellar. A fifth en suite bedroom with a shower room completes this floor.\n\nBeneath the exposed beams of the top floor, a majestic cathedral-ceilinged living room invites relaxation. Equipped with a video projector, it opens onto an east-facing balcony and a west-facing terrace, enjoying optimal sunshine throughout the day and offering magnificent views of the surrounding alpine landscape.\n\nEvery detail has been meticulously considered, from the bespoke finishes to the carefully selected materials, creating a warm, elegant, and decidedly exclusive atmosphere.\n\nA large double garage and several outdoor parking spaces complete this rare property, intended for clients seeking an exceptional property in the heart of Megève.",
