    "description": "Hidden from view, in a rare and idyllic setting on the banks of the Saône, this exceptional estate offers 562 sqm of living space set within 6,640 sqm of beautifully landscaped grounds.\n\nFrom the moment you step inside, the property impresses with its elegant proportions, abundant natural light, and the impeccable quality of its renovation.\n\nThe spectacular reception room, spanning nearly 200 sqm, provides an extraordinary entertaining space, designed for hosting on both a grand and intimate scale in an atmosphere that is warm, refined, and effortlessly elegant. Extending from this space, a large conservatory opens generously onto the gardens, creating a seamless connection between indoors and outdoors.\n\nOutside, the estate unfolds onto an expansive terrace, a heated 16 x 4 metre swimming pool, and a private landscaped park where every perspective has been carefully designed to preserve tranquillity, privacy, and an exceptional lifestyle.\n\nA magnificent central staircase leads to the sleeping quarters, comprising six bedrooms. The principal suite features a private study, a walk-in dressing room, and an en-suite bathroom. Two additional suites each benefit from their own en-suite bathrooms, while three further bedrooms share a separate family bathroom.\n\nThe timeless charm of the original architecture blends harmoniously with contemporary comfort and premium finishes, including underfloor heating throughout, reversible air conditioning, advanced home automation, and a state-of-the-art security system.\n\nThe estate also includes a 70 sqm caretaker's house, a workshop, a traditional dovecote, and a pétanque court, completing this rare property just moments from Lyon.\n\nA discreet and elegant family residence designed for both everyday living and entertaining, offering a unique lifestyle where nature, comfort, and privacy exist in perfect harmony.\n\nIdeally located just 15 minutes from the centre of Lyon and 10 minutes from Ombrosa International School.",
