    "description": "Just steps from the Marché des Enfants Rouges, in the heart of the Haut-Marais, this exceptional 228 sqm penthouse occupies the top floor of a former printing house. Crowned by two private rooftop terraces of 27.5 sqm and 29.5 sqm overlooking the rooftops of Paris, it offers an exceptionally rare living environment where architecture, volume and design exist in perfect harmony.\n\nConceived as a true work of interior architecture, the property has undergone a complete transformation. Every space has been redesigned, every circulation carefully reimagined, and every perspective thoughtfully considered. The meticulous selection of materials, bespoke finishes and custom-crafted joinery reflects an uncompromising level of craftsmanship. Polished concrete, marble, solid wood, steel, custom-made glass partitions and integrated cabinetry come together in a composition of remarkable elegance, where every detail has been executed with absolute precision.\n\nThe reception areas unfold around an expansive living room with impressive ceiling heights, seamlessly extending into a bespoke open-plan kitchen and dining area. Original industrial features blend effortlessly with refined contemporary design, creating an atmosphere that is both warm and strikingly distinctive.\n\nThe private quarters comprise three beautifully appointed bedroom suites. Two feature their own en-suite bathrooms, while the impressive principal suite offers a generous walk-in dressing room and a spectacular bathroom. A fully equipped utility room, also serving as a laundry room, together with extensive bespoke storage throughout, completes this impeccably designed layout.\n\nBold yet perfectly balanced, the interior design enhances the architecture without ever overshadowing it. Designer furnishings, panoramic wall coverings, handcrafted mosaics and noble materials give the property a distinctive and timeless identity.\n\nExceptional for its location, remarkable for the quality of its design and truly unique in character, this apartment embodies a sophisticated contemporary lifestyle in one of Paris' most sought-after neighbourhoods. A discreet and exceptional residence for discerning buyers with a passion for architecture, design and truly outstanding properties.",
