    "description": "Located at the top of a luxury high-rise, this sumptuous 271 m² duplex penthouse—extended by two ground-level terraces totaling 144 m²—offers a spectacular, unobstructed panoramic view of Paris’s most beautiful vistas.\n\nOn one side, a breathtaking view of the Eiffel Tower; on the other, the Bois de Boulogne, the La Défense skyline, and Mont Valérien. A rare property where every room enjoys an exceptional setting. \n\nUpon entering, an elegant gallery leads to a majestic triple reception area of nearly 120 m², bathed in light thanks to its dual east/west exposure. This reception area opens onto a 20 m² balcony, offering a unique view of the Bois de Boulogne, La Défense, and Mont Valérien.\n\nThe 36 m² master suite, a true haven of serenity, features direct access to a private terrace, a bathroom, and a separate guest restroom.\n\nThree other bedrooms, perfectly laid out, each have their own bathroom facilities: two feature private bathrooms, while the third is adjacent to a shower room. A steam room and a guest restroom complete this sleeping area.\n\nAt the heart of the apartment, a remarkable 37 m² open-concept kitchen and dining area, fully equipped, opens onto two terraces measuring 112 m² and 32 m²—true open-air living spaces, ideal for entertaining or enjoying moments of relaxation in complete privacy.\n\nSpanning the length of the apartment and bathed in light throughout the day, this penthouse captivates with its high-end features: air conditioning, refined finishes, contemporary amenities, and exceptional spaciousness.\n\nThe apartment is offered fully furnished, both indoors and outdoors, though it can also be purchased unfurnished according to the future owner’s preferences.\n\nTwo storage units complete this exceptional property.\n\nThere is the option to purchase a double garage space separately.",
