    "description": "Set within one of Megève's most sought-after locations, between the charming village centre and the prestigious Mont d'Arbois, this exceptional private estate extends over more than 800 sq.m., embodying the very finest in Alpine luxury living.\n\nMeticulously designed down to the smallest detail, the chalet seamlessly blends timeless craftsmanship and noble materials with outstanding contemporary amenities, creating a residence of rare distinction and exclusivity.\n\nThe generous reception areas, bathed in natural light, open onto beautifully landscaped, tree-lined gardens, providing a peaceful and private setting to be enjoyed throughout every season.\n\nThe property offers seven luxurious en-suite bedrooms, including an impressive 50+ sq.m. principal suite, conceived as a private apartment offering absolute comfort and refined elegance.\n\nDedicated entirely to relaxation and well-being, the wellness area features an indoor swimming pool, hammam, sauna, and fully equipped fitness room. Entertaining is equally well catered for with a private home cinema, games room, and an elegant wine cellar, perfect for collectors and wine enthusiasts alike.\n\nDesigned to meet the highest standards of modern luxury, the chalet is equipped with a lift serving every floor, a state-of-the-art security and alarm system, and a secure underground garage accommodating up to three vehicles.\n\nEvery element has been carefully considered to satisfy the expectations of an international clientele seeking a truly exceptional property combining privacy, cutting-edge technology, comfort, and understated sophistication.\n\nIdeally located just minutes from the ski slopes, the Mont d'Arbois Golf Course and Megève's renowned boutiques and gourmet restaurants, this remarkable residence offers an unparalleled lifestyle in one of the Alps' most prestigious destinations.\n\nA truly exceptional home where every space reflects elegance, privacy, and excellence.",
