    "description": "Just a few minutes from the centre of Megève, in the sought-after Les Chozeaux area, this exceptional 672 sqm chalet offers a contemporary interpretation of traditional Alpine architecture, combining aged timber, natural stone and expansive openings onto the surrounding mountains.\n\nBuilt in 2022, the chalet is defined by its impressive volumes, starting with a spectacular, light-filled living area. A double-height lounge centred around a statement fireplace flows naturally into the dining room and kitchen, while large picture windows extend the living spaces towards the terraces and balconies.\n\nThe property features five en-suite bedrooms, each with its own bathroom and dressing room. On the upper floor, the master suite enjoys a more private setting with its own balcony.\n\nDesigned as a true private retreat, the chalet offers an outstanding range of amenities: indoor swimming pool, sauna, fitness room, massage area, private cinema, billiard room and ski room, as well as a children’s dormitory that can also be used as a games room.\n\nA lift serves the different floors, while a double garage provides space for two cars.\n\nOutside, the chalet sits within nearly 2,000 sqm of grounds, preserving both privacy and a privileged connection with its mountain surroundings.\n\nA property designed for entertaining, spending time with family and enjoying Megève throughout the seasons, with the level of comfort and finish expected from a chalet of this calibre.",
