    "description": "Just minutes from the historic centre of Aix-en-Provence, in one of the region’s most sought-after villages, this exceptional contemporary estate offers a rare lifestyle within approximately one hectare of beautifully landscaped grounds.\n\nFrom the moment you arrive, the property captivates. Its clean architectural lines blend harmoniously with lush tropical landscaping inspired by the most beautiful Balinese gardens. The setting is enhanced by a spectacular swimming pool that extends seamlessly into a landscaped ornamental pond, creating a peaceful and romantic atmosphere that invites relaxation and contemplation.\n\nDesigned by a renowned architect, the villa showcases remarkable volumes flooded with natural light. Expansive terraces naturally extend the reception areas outdoors, while the impressive open-plan living space brings together the lounge, dining room and high-end designer kitchen in a refined contemporary style.\n\nConceived as a true sanctuary dedicated to well-being, every detail has been carefully considered to create an atmosphere of understated luxury, comfort and serenity.\nIts location is equally outstanding: nestled at the foot of the iconic Sainte-Victoire Mountain, less than 10 minutes from Aix-en-Provence TGV station, only 20 minutes from Marseille Provence International Airport, close to some of Provence’s finest golf courses and just five minutes from tennis facilities, the property perfectly combines tranquillity, accessibility and an exceptional lifestyle.\nFor further information or to arrange a private viewing, please contact Nathalie Normand +33 6 34 15 83 93, nathalie@kretz.fr",
