    "description": "Located just a short distance from the iconic Place des Lices, this exceptional property of approximately 500 sqm offers a rare combination of elegance, privacy and the quintessential Saint-Tropez lifestyle. Set within approximately one hectare of beautifully landscaped grounds, it enjoys a peaceful and private setting while remaining only minutes from the village.\n\nFrom the moment you enter, the property impresses with the exceptional quality of its materials and the meticulous attention to detail throughout. Generous volumes, refined finishes and carefully considered architectural choices create an atmosphere that is both contemporary and warm, while retaining a timeless elegance.\n\nThe spacious living room forms the heart of the home. Opening extensively onto the outdoors, it creates a seamless connection between the interiors and the garden while benefiting from an abundance of natural light. The fully equipped kitchen follows the same philosophy, combining elegance, functionality and high-quality finishes.\n\nThe villa features six en-suite bedrooms, each designed as a private retreat. The magnificent master suite stands out in particular for its generous proportions, refined finishes and exceptionally elegant atmosphere.\n\nOutside, the property reveals one of its most distinctive features: an extraordinary exotic garden, home to more than one hundred carefully selected plant varieties. Lush and beautifully landscaped, it creates a feeling of escape and absolute privacy, despite being so close to the heart of Saint-Tropez.\n\nThe outdoor spaces have been designed to fully embrace the Mediterranean lifestyle. A swimming pool is complemented by a dedicated counter-current swimming lane, ideal for combining relaxation and exercise.\n\nFor sports and entertainment, the property also features a genuine private padel court, an exceptionally rare amenity so close to the village.\n\nThree separate annexes complete the property, providing comfortable accommodation for family, guests or staff while preserving privacy within the main residence. A large garage further enhances the property, offering secure and convenient space for several vehicles.\n\nWith its exceptional finishes, lush botanical garden, extensive outdoor spaces and approximately one hectare of land, this property offers a truly rare combination in Saint-Tropez.\n\nA private and refined address where exceptional craftsmanship meets generous outdoor living, just moments from Place des Lices.",
