    "description": "Situated between Pézenas and Montpellier, in a completely peaceful setting, this exceptional wine-growing estate featuring a château and outbuildings is ideal for lovers of history, beautiful stone architecture and wine.\n\nBuilt in the 18th century for a French officer, the château – measuring approximately 900m² and set within 2.5 hectares of landscaped grounds and 25 hectares of vineyards – is the centrepiece of the estate. It comprises spacious reception rooms, two kitchens (one of which is semi-professional) and seven luxurious suites, some with terraces and jacuzzis. Five of these suites are currently operated as luxury guest rooms.\n\nThe wine from the 25 hectares of IGP-classified vineyards is produced in the estate’s winery, which has a capacity of 1,200 hectolitres and features an 800m² cellar and a barrel cellar housing 500 barrels. Production is currently entrusted to a renowned winery, ensuring high-quality output. These wine-making facilities are let out, generating additional income.\n\nThe 700m² of outbuildings house seven luxury holiday cottages, accommodating between two and 11 people, and a spa area with a jacuzzi, sauna and two massage rooms. The total accommodation capacity is 65 people.\nThe restoration of all the buildings was carried out over several years to the highest standards, with the aim of providing the utmost in luxury and comfort whilst preserving the period features and the spirit of the place.\nThe immaculately maintained grounds are planted with Mediterranean species and adorned with antique statues and fountains. It features two swimming pools (one of which is heated) and a large pool house.\n\nIn addition to running the holiday cottages and guest rooms, the business also organises events (weddings, seminars, team-building activities, private parties, etc.).\nThe layout of this property makes it suitable both for continuing the existing business and for converting it into a family home for an epicurean connoisseur.\n\n15 minutes from Pézenas, 30 minutes from the beaches and 40 minutes from Montpellier and its airport.\nInformation pack available on request",
