    "description": "At the heart of a private 30-hectare estate, in an exceptionally peaceful and preserved setting, this historic property of approximately 300 sq.m offers a rare opportunity on the Gulf of Saint-Tropez real estate market.\n\nNestled within lush greenery, just a few minutes from Saint-Tropez and the beaches, the property enjoys a privileged setting, sheltered from prying eyes and the hustle and bustle of the summer season.\n\nThe former farmhouse has retained all of its authenticity and offers remarkable potential for renovation. Its existing volumes lend themselves perfectly to the creation of a characterful family residence, while preserving the soul of the property and its original features.\n\nThe property comprises 7 bedrooms, reception areas and a living room enhanced by an original period fireplace, a true reminder of the building’s rich history and character. A partial sea view further enhances this exceptional setting.\n\nOutside, a natural pond blends harmoniously into the surrounding landscape, immersed in lush greenery. It offers an authentic Provençal countryside atmosphere, while remaining just moments from Saint-Tropez.\n\nA confidential and truly unique property, ideal for a bespoke renovation project in one of the most sought-after areas of the Gulf of Saint-Tropez.",
